- `py/int-floordiv` (1053) and `py/int-mod` (1061) are native, through
  `divmod-pos`.
- `py/floordiv` (1154) and `py/mod` (1162) use them; their float arms go
  through `data/float-value`.
- `py/division-check` (1144) is safe: `py/zero?` (165) uses `=`.
