  and `py/slice-positions` (1697: `(- n 1)`, `(= step 0)`). `py/slice-of`
  (1714) uses them.
- `py/repeat` (1008): native `(< 0 n)` and `(- n 1)` in
  `py/repeat-items` (1004) and `py/repeat-str` (1006).
